  ["2024-01-01T00:01:00Z", 1],
  ["2024-01-01T00:02:00Z", 2]
]
-- parity_exempt --
reason: no-comparable-oracle
detail: `{ } >> { } | count_over_time()` answers with a time series rather than with a span set, so runTempoParity has no set of matched spans to compare
